{"id":"C5cb62ee1c5aa825b4773","zh":"轨道不平顺谱","en":"track irregularity spectrum","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"轨道不平顺随空间频率或波长变化的统计谱表示。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C5cb62ee1c5aa825b4773","zh":"轨道不平顺谱","en":"track irregularity spectrum","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H43af956d630543616e72","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2013）"},{"id":"C20e082cb08180dd04b1f","zh":"轨道不平顺谱","en":"track irregularity spectrum","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","group_id":"H43af956d630543616e72","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道随机动力学 · 徐磊等（2018）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D9bce0d174b920b59d865","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"轨道不平顺谱"},{"id":"D26f2cf25704966cfd4e8","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"track irregularity spectrum"}],"sources":{"P122":{"id":"P122","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,李晓健,孟宪洪","year":"2013","doi":null,"journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway"},"P124":{"id":"P124","title":"高速铁路( 京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,徐伟昌,董连成","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.04.001","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-analysis-of-track-irregularity-spectrum-for-high-speed-railway-beijing-shanghai-shanghai-hangzhou-an"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sb885508d8f3f2ab05935","source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"为了提高轨道不平顺谱的计算精度,在计算轨道不平顺谱时,一般应进行数据预处理,采用文献[3]方法进行异常数据剔除。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S2b8ef40c44cf3f9cdbda","source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"图1 所示为朔黄重载铁路线基于2012 年4 月轨检数据的轨道不平顺谱、基于2011 年7 月—2012 年4 月的各单项不平顺统计谱及德国高低干扰谱的对比。","citations":[{"source_id":"P122","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S4c2e2e1a5728276abdbc","source_id":"P124","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"JOURNAL OF RAILWAY SCIENCE AND ENGINEERING Aug.2013 高速铁路(京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析 * 陈宪麦 1,2,徐磊 1,2,徐伟昌 3,董连成 (1.中南大学土木工程学院,湖南长沙410075; 2.高速铁路建造技术国家工程实验室,湖南长沙410075; 3.上海铁路局工务处,上海200070; 4.冻土工程国家重点实验室,甘肃兰州730000) 摘要: 利用改进的Welch 周期图法计算了京沪、沪杭、沪宁等高速铁路的轨道不平顺功率谱密度,从波长和幅值2 个角度分析其轨道不平顺特征,并对成因进行探析; 利用相干理论对轨道不平顺与车体振动加速度进行分析,探讨高速线路轨道不平顺引起的车体不利波长。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Scfb266780472e7c97a74","source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"轨道不平顺谱的计算分析 1.1 数据来源及谱估计方法轨道不平顺样本数据来源于2010 年沪宁、沪杭高速铁路和2011 年京沪高速铁路的检测数据, 采样间距为0.25 m。","citations":[{"source_id":"P124","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_concept_id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_zh":"车体振动加速度","target_en":"car-body vibration acceleration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C51283259fbd72ffbd411","target_concept_id":"C51283259fbd72ffbd411","target_zh":"功率谱密度","target_en":"power spectral density","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_concept_id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_zh":"高速铁路","target_en":"high -speed railway","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C21672f3eade194acbf1b","target_concept_id":"C21672f3eade194acbf1b","target_zh":"车体振动","target_en":"car-body vibration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P122","title":"朔黄重载铁路轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦,李晓健,孟宪洪","year":"2013","doi":null,"journal_citation":"中南大学学报(自然科学版)","label":"徐磊等（2013）","overview_slug":"2013-track-irregularity-spectrum-analysis-of-shenchi-huanghua-heavy-haul-railway"},{"id":"P124","title":"高速铁路( 京沪、沪宁、沪杭线) 轨道不平顺谱分析","authors":"陈宪麦,徐磊,徐伟昌,董连成","year":"2013","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2013.04.